9. Why This Works

Since revisiting roads is allowed:

We can move anywhere inside the connected component.

We can intentionally include any edge in that component.

After including the smallest edge, we can still reach city n.


Therefore,

Minimum score

=

Minimum edge

inside the connected component containing city 1

Hence DFS/BFS or DSU always returns the correct answer.


